            <ArticleTitle>[Localized 4-sec and rhythm in the EEG].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>285-90</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The author, after presenting diagnostic criteria and interpretations of the 4-sec. rhythm in the brain potential record, describes a case where this symptom is localized in the right occipital region. He also points out that further elucidation should be possible by a differential establishment of indications.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
